/T (In a university environment, information about club recruitment drives, workshops, hackathons, seminars, competitions, and other opportunities is often shared through multiple channels such as WhatsApp groups, Instagram pages, LMS announcements, and student communities. Due to this scattered distribution of information, many students remain unaware of important events and deadlines, leading to missed opportunities for learning, networking, and skill development. )
